Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "WrongWayVehicleIntrusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Ego vehicle" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Oncoming vehicle driving in ego lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Oncoming vehicle driving in the wrong lane, encroaching on ego vehicle path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Oncoming vehicle driving in the wrong lane, encroaching on ego vehicle path
Severity Score: 0.95